      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.12,
          "end": 4.23,
          "en": "As mentioned in this module,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.23,
          "end": 7.18,
          "en": "we are going to build the Coach Finder app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.18,
          "end": 11.61,
          "en": "So a web application, a website built with Vue.js,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.61,
          "end": 15.63,
          "en": "which should help us find a coach that, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.63,
          "end": 19,
          "en": "helps us become better in web development, whatever.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19,
          "end": 21.83,
          "en": "And for this website, this web app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.83,
          "end": 25.87,
          "en": "which we're going to build will have two main features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.87,
          "end": 28.67,
          "en": "It has the find a coach feature,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.67,
          "end": 32.49,
          "en": "and it has a feature to send requests messages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.49,
          "end": 36.29,
          "en": "to potential coaches which we want to contact.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.29,
          "end": 38.55,
          "en": "Now for the find a coach part,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.55,
          "end": 42.75,
          "en": "we want to be able to list all available coaches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 42.75,
          "end": 46.98,
          "en": "So all the coaches that signed up with our application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.98,
          "end": 50.49,
          "en": "we want to be able to view the coach details.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.49,
          "end": 53.51,
          "en": "We will be able to register as a coach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.51,
          "end": 56.12,
          "en": "and we'll be able to contact a coach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.12,
          "end": 60.13,
          "en": "Now, the contact a coach feature also establishes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.13,
          "end": 62.41,
          "en": "the connection to the other part of this web app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.41,
          "end": 64.2,
          "en": "the requests part,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.2,
          "end": 67.62,
          "en": "we will be able to send such requests to coaches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.62,
          "end": 68.58,
          "en": "And as a coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.58,
          "end": 72.26,
          "en": "we can view incoming requests so that we then potentially",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.26,
          "end": 73.89,
          "en": "can reply to them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.89,
          "end": 77.26,
          "en": "This is the app, the web app we're going to build.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 77.26,
          "end": 80.57,
          "en": "And the focus of this module will, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.57,
          "end": 85.46000000000001,
          "en": "be on adding as many key view features as possible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.46000000000001,
          "end": 87.14,
          "en": "so that you get a very good idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.14,
          "end": 90.343,
          "en": "of how building real view apps works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.35,
          "end": 94.38,
          "en": "Now for that, before we write any code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.38,
          "end": 96.8,
          "en": "we of course wanna plan the app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.8,
          "end": 101.07,
          "en": "We want to have a clear plan on which code we need to write,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.07,
          "end": 104.13,
          "en": "because even though we haven't done this thus far",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.13,
          "end": 107.12,
          "en": "in the course, since it's a Vue course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.12,
          "end": 109.47,
          "en": "this actually will be a major part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.47,
          "end": 111.02000000000001,
          "en": "of any app you're building.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.02000000000001,
          "end": 114.15,
          "en": "You need a plan, which then of course is allowed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.15,
          "end": 117.39,
          "en": "to change over time, but you need an initial plan",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.39,
          "end": 119.28,
          "en": "before you start working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.28,
          "end": 121.77,
          "en": "Otherwise you don't know which code to write.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 121.77,
          "end": 125.01,
          "en": "Now there is no single right blueprint to follow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.01,
          "end": 128.12,
          "en": "There are tons of different ways of planning an application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 128.12,
          "end": 131.55,
          "en": "And here's just one possible way of doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 131.55,
          "end": 135.79,
          "en": "I like to start by defining the key features of the app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 135.79,
          "end": 137.4,
          "en": "I wanna build.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.4,
          "end": 140.65,
          "en": "So in this case, find a coach and requests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.65,
          "end": 144.72,
          "en": "And then the sup features that belong to these areas",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.72,
          "end": 148.24,
          "en": "like listing all coaches, registering as a coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.24,
          "end": 151.03,
          "en": "sending messages and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.03,
          "end": 153.21,
          "en": "Now, once the features are defined,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.21,
          "end": 156.74,
          "en": "we can do two very important things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.74,
          "end": 160.52,
          "en": "The first important thing which we can do is that we can",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 160.52,
          "end": 163.76,
          "en": "derive the data we need, the data models we need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.76,
          "end": 168.72,
          "en": "and in the Vue world data for the Vuex store layout we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 168.72,
          "end": 172.98,
          "en": "We can plan our application wide state and our getters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 172.98,
          "end": 176.88,
          "en": "and also the actions and mutations we will most likely need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 176.88,
          "end": 179.77,
          "en": "Now from experience, I can tell you typically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.77,
          "end": 181.41,
          "en": "you will plan something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 181.41,
          "end": 183.48,
          "en": "and then once you start building the app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 183.48,
          "end": 186.75,
          "en": "your plans change and you add more actions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.75,
          "end": 189.45,
          "en": "or different actions and different mutations",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.45,
          "end": 193.84,
          "en": "than initially planned because it turns out to work better.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.84,
          "end": 195.51,
          "en": "And that is okay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.51,
          "end": 199.46,
          "en": "I'm not a fan of planning for days before you get started.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.46,
          "end": 201.32,
          "en": "I rather get started quickly,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 201.32,
          "end": 204.203,
          "en": "but a rough plan definitely won't hurt.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 205.28,
          "end": 207.22,
          "en": "Now, the other important part,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 207.22,
          "end": 209.45,
          "en": "which is not necessarily the second step,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.45,
          "end": 212.07,
          "en": "you can also start with that other part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.07,
          "end": 215.95,
          "en": "is that you derive to design, the layout of this application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.95,
          "end": 218.28,
          "en": "and you plan which components you need",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 218.28,
          "end": 221.72,
          "en": "and how these components are related.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 221.72,
          "end": 225.7,
          "en": "This also includes the part where you plan your routes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 225.7,
          "end": 227.97,
          "en": "which you wanna set up with the router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 227.97,
          "end": 230.313,
          "en": "So which different pages do you want to have?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 231.18,
          "end": 232.99,
          "en": "Now, when I say design here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 232.99,
          "end": 236.62,
          "en": "I don't necessarily mean the colors and the font",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 236.62,
          "end": 239.27,
          "en": "or something like that, because whilst this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 239.27,
          "end": 242.37,
          "en": "of course, is a part often that will be done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 242.37,
          "end": 244.78,
          "en": "by some designer for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.78,
          "end": 247.25,
          "en": "I personally am not a designer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 247.25,
          "end": 251.98,
          "en": "so my designs look okayish, but not great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 251.98,
          "end": 254.19,
          "en": "I'm really talking about the Vue part,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 254.19,
          "end": 257.453,
          "en": "so the components and how these components are related.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 258.37,
          "end": 260.9,
          "en": "These are the major two things we wanna do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 260.9,
          "end": 262.64,
          "en": "and therefore these are the steps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
